🔴 The Persian Gulf Waterway Management Authority says two bulk carriers that recently departed for ports in the southern Persian Gulf states using forged documents and without prior coordination faced legal action. However, they avoided being placed on the non-compliance list by accepting the commitments announced by PGSA.

